+Set source-mapped logpoints (`set_logpoints`), configure virtual WebAuthn authenticators (`configure_webauthn`), watch and hot-reload MCP configuration files with `--watchConfig`, and analyze heap snapshots and V8 execution contexts offline without a browser connection.
 
